{"seq":2,"slug":"evt-hydrology-climate","title":"水文与气候","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/extreme-value-theory/practice/evt-hydrology-climate","wordCount":1402,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"水文与气候\">水文与气候</h1><p>极值理论的故乡是水文学。早在 Gumbel 把极值统计系统化之前，工程师就在为大坝、堤防、桥梁估计&quot;设计洪水&quot;。荷兰在 1953 年北海大洪水夺去上千条生命后，把三角洲工程的防护标准定到了万年一遇——这是一个纯粹的极值外推问题，没有 EVT 根本无从下手。今天，气候变化又给这个古老领域抛来新难题：当极端降水逐年增强、海平面持续上升，&quot;百年一遇&quot;本身在移动，平稳假设宣告失效。本篇把 EVT 的工具映射到水文气候的行话上，并讲清非平稳建模这一前沿，最后延伸到可靠性工程的&quot;最弱环节&quot;视角。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-设计洪水就是回归水平\">核心概念：设计洪水就是回归水平</h2><p>水文工程的核心概念，几乎都是 EVT 术语的别名。&quot;<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 年一遇设计洪水&quot;就是<a href=\"../estimation/return-levels\">回归水平与重现期</a>定义的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 年回归水平 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>T</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z_T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>；&quot;设计标准&quot;就是选定的重现期 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span>。经典流程是取河流的年最大流量序列，用<a href=\"../models/gev-block-maxima\">GEV 与块最大值</a>拟合，再反算 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>T</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z_T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 作为堤防高度依据。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>水文/气候术语</th>\n<th>对应 EVT 概念</th>\n<th>典型设计标准</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>设计洪水 / 设计水位</td>\n<td>回归水平 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>T</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z_T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>城市排水 10–50 年</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重现期 / 设防标准</td>\n<td>重现期 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>一般堤防 50–100 年</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>年最大流量序列</td>\n<td>块最大值（年块）</td>\n<td>大坝 1000–10000 年</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>概率洪水 PMF</td>\n<td>极高分位数外推</td>\n<td>核电站取极端值</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>水文领域对块最大值方法情有独钟（年最大值天然消除季节性），但记录较短的小流域越来越多改用<a href=\"../models/pot-gpd\">POT 与广义帕累托</a>，把一年内多场暴雨都纳入，缓解数据稀缺。降雨工程还广泛使用 <strong>IDF 曲线</strong>（Intensity-Duration-Frequency，强度-历时-频率），它本质是对不同历时的降水极值分别做 EVT 拟合，再把回归水平按历时组织成一族曲线，供排水管网设计直接查用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"平稳性已死-非平稳极值建模\">平稳性已死：非平稳极值建模</h2><p>经典 EVT 公式全部默认数据独立同分布——分布不随时间变。但 IPCC 第六次评估及后续报告反复确认：极端高温、强降水、海平面在大尺度上呈现明确趋势。把过去百年的平稳模型外推到未来，会系统性低估风险——气候学界称这个困境为&quot;平稳性已死&quot;（stationarity is dead）。</p>\n<p>应对之道是<a href=\"../estimation/evt-uncertainty\">极值不确定性</a>介绍的非平稳模型：让 GEV 参数随协变量变化。最常见是让位置参数随时间或全球平均温度线性漂移：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mtext> </mtext><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi>ξ</mi><mo>=</mo><mtext>常数</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu(t) = \\mu_0 + \\mu_1\\, t, \\qquad \\xi = \\text{常数}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.046em;\">ξ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">常数</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[年最大值序列] --&gt; B{有无趋势/突变?}&#10;  B --&gt;|平稳| C[经典 GEV&lt;br/&gt;固定回归水平]&#10;  B --&gt;|有趋势| D[非平稳 GEV&lt;br/&gt;mu 随时间或温度变]&#10;  D --&gt; E[回归水平成为时间函数&lt;br/&gt;z_T 逐年漂移]&#10;  E --&gt; F{如何用于设计?}&#10;  F --&gt;|设计寿命内| G[积分有效重现期&lt;br/&gt;或取设计期末水平]&#10;  C --&gt; H[传统设防]&#10;  G --&gt; H\">flowchart TD\n  A[年最大值序列] --&gt; B{有无趋势/突变?}\n  B --&gt;|平稳| C[经典 GEV&lt;br/&gt;固定回归水平]\n  B --&gt;|有趋势| D[非平稳 GEV&lt;br/&gt;mu 随时间或温度变]\n  D --&gt; E[回归水平成为时间函数&lt;br/&gt;z_T 逐年漂移]\n  E --&gt; F{如何用于设计?}\n  F --&gt;|设计寿命内| G[积分有效重现期&lt;br/&gt;或取设计期末水平]\n  C --&gt; H[传统设防]\n  G --&gt; H</pre><p>非平稳带来一个概念难题：当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>T</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z_T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 逐年变化时，&quot;百年一遇&quot;指哪一年的？工程上有几种约定——取结构设计寿命末年的回归水平、或在整个设计期上积分得到&quot;有效重现期&quot;。形状参数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ξ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\xi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.046em;\">ξ</span></span></span></span></span> 通常仍设为常数，因为它本就难估，再让它随时间变会让模型不可识别（见<a href=\"../estimation/tail-index-estimation\">尾指数估计</a>）。2025 年发布的 Python 库 <code>nsEVDx</code> 专攻非平稳极值，R 的 <code>extRemes</code> 与 <code>climextRemes</code> 也长期支持协变量建模，是气候极值研究的标准工具。</p>\n<h2 id=\"复合与空间极值\">复合与空间极值</h2><p>真实的水文气候灾害常常不是单变量的。<strong>复合事件</strong>——如风暴潮叠加强降水、高温叠加干旱——的风险远大于各成分单独相加，需要多元极值理论刻画变量间的尾部相依（tail dependence）。<strong>空间极值</strong>则关心极端事件在地理上的同步性：一场暴雨可能同时淹没整个流域，max-stable 过程与极值 copula 是建模这类空间结构的工具。这些多元/空间扩展超出本 hub 的单变量范围，但它们的地基仍是前面各章的 GEV/GPD 与吸引域理论。</p>\n<h2 id=\"可靠性工程-最弱环节的-weibull\">可靠性工程：最弱环节的 Weibull</h2><p>把视角从&quot;最大&quot;转到&quot;最小&quot;，EVT 同样适用。一条链子的强度由最弱一环决定，一批材料的疲劳寿命由最早断裂的样本决定——这是&quot;最小值极值&quot;问题，通过取负号 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\min(X_i) = -\\max(-X_i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 转化为最大值框架。其极限往往是 <a href=\"../foundations/three-extreme-types\">三类极值分布</a> 中的 Weibull（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ξ</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\xi&lt;0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.046em;\">ξ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>，有界），这正是 Weibull 分布在材料强度、电子元件寿命建模中无处不在的深层原因：它是&quot;最弱环节&quot;的渐近分布。可靠性工程因此与水文共享同一套 EVT 内核，只是关心的尾巴在另一端。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>水文工程的&quot;设计洪水&quot;&quot;设防标准&quot;&quot;年最大流量&quot;分别就是 EVT 的回归水平、重现期、块最大值，IDF 曲线是按历时组织的回归水平族。</li>\n<li>块最大值（年最大值）是水文传统，记录短的小流域改用 POT 以充分利用数据。</li>\n<li>气候变化使平稳假设失效（&quot;平稳性已死&quot;），非平稳 GEV 让位置参数随时间/温度漂移，回归水平成为时间函数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ξ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\xi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.046em;\">ξ</span></span></span></span></span> 通常仍固定。</li>\n<li>复合事件与空间极值需多元极值理论刻画尾部相依，超出单变量范围但地基相同。</li>\n<li>可靠性工程的&quot;最弱环节&quot;问题通过取负转为最大值框架，极限多为 Weibull，与水文共享 EVT 内核。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>方法来源：<a href=\"../models/gev-block-maxima\">GEV 与块最大值</a>、<a href=\"../estimation/return-levels\">回归水平与重现期</a>、<a href=\"../estimation/evt-uncertainty\">极值不确定性</a>；Weibull 理论：<a href=\"../foundations/three-extreme-types\">三类极值分布</a>。</li>\n<li>非平稳趋势检验所需的检验框架，见<a href=\"../../probability-statistics/hypothesis-testing/nonparametric-tests\">非参数检验</a>。</li>\n<li>灾害情景的随机模拟可借助<a href=\"../../markov-chain-monte-carlo/foundations/monte-carlo-integration\">蒙特卡洛积分</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"水文与气候","id":"水文与气候"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：设计洪水就是回归水平","id":"核心概念-设计洪水就是回归水平"},{"level":2,"text":"平稳性已死：非平稳极值建模","id":"平稳性已死-非平稳极值建模"},{"level":2,"text":"复合与空间极值","id":"复合与空间极值"},{"level":2,"text":"可靠性工程：最弱环节的 Weibull","id":"可靠性工程-最弱环节的-weibull"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"金融风险 VaR/ES","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/extreme-value-theory/practice/evt-finance-risk"},"next":{"title":"极值分析陷阱","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/extreme-value-theory/practice/evt-pitfalls"}}